/*
 * Aggregates binary operators related to pointer operands.
 *
 * This module groups all binary operators whose semantics involve pointer
 * values. Pointer-specific operators include:
 *
 *   - pointer arithmetic (addition, subtraction),
 *   - pointer comparisons (equality, ordering),
 *   - and any other binary operator whose behavior depends on pointer types.
 *
 * These operators are implemented in dedicated submodules to keep the pointer
 * operator logic isolated and consistent with the rest of the binary operator
 * hierarchy.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::operator::binary::pointer
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/operator/binary/pointer.yr
